<% provide(:title, 'Rhombus - FAQS') %>

   <style type="text/css">
    @media screen and (min-width: 1200px) {
        .w-container {
          max-width: 1170px;
        }
      }
      .w-slider-nav-invert>div {
    background-color: #e5e5e5; !important
}
  </style>

  <%= render 'shared/static_pages_header' %>


  <%#= render 'shared/full_messages' %>



<div class="w-section banner inner _4" id="top" data-ix="show-social-and-nav">
    <div class="w-container">
      <div class="div-center" data-ix="show-navigation">
        <h1 class="h-inner" data-ix="h-inner"><span class="white-1 about-hero-text">Frequently asked questions</span></h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="w-section section">
    <div class="w-container">
      <div class="tittle-wrapper faqs-icon"><img src="<%= asset_path 'FAQ Icon.png' %>">
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="w-row">
          <div class="w-col w-col-3">
            <div class="icon-wrapper">
              <h4 class="faqs-section-1-text">WHAT IS RHOMBUS?</h4>
              <p class="faqs-section-1-text">Rhombus takes the hassle out of collecting payments or donations from your customers, members or group of friends on any mobile device, using the most ubiquitous messaging system – SMS. The friction-free process lets users make a purchase or donation instantly by texting an amount and description to your Rhombus number!</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-col w-col-3">
            <div class="icon-wrapper">
              <h4 class="faqs-section-1-text">HOW DO I SEND A PAYMENT WITH RHOMBUS?</h4>
              <p class="faqs-section-1-text">To send a payment to a merchant, local business, or non-profit, simply text the amount and description to their Rhombus number in this format: “$XX.XX Description”. For example; “$20 2 Burritos and a soda” or “$50 Feed the Children outreach”</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-col w-col-3">
            <div class="icon-wrapper">
              <h4 class="faqs-section-1-text">HOW DO I KNOW MY PAYMENT WAS SENT?</h4>
              <p class="faqs-section-1-text">You will receive a payment confirmation by text immediately after. You will also receive an electronic receipt by email for every payment you make.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-col w-col-3">
            <div class="icon-wrapper">
              <h4 class="faqs-section-1-text">IS THERE A LIMIT TO HOW MANY CHARACTERS I CAN SEND?</h4>
              <p class="faqs-section-1-text">Yes. There is a 160 character limit for each individual payment you send using Rhombus.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-row row-spc x2">
          <div class="w-col w-col-3">
            <div class="icon-wrapper">
              <h4 class="faqs-section-1-text">IS THERE A MINIMUM OR MAXIMUM AMOUNT i CAN SEND THROUGH RHOMBUS?</h4>
              <p class="faqs-section-1-text">Yes. You can send a minimum payment of $5 and a maximum payment of $15,000 using Rhombus.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-col w-col-3">
            <div class="icon-wrapper">
              <h4 class="faqs-section-1-text">ARE THERE FEES?</h4>
              <p class="faqs-section-1-text">Sending a payment with Rhombus is&nbsp;completely free&nbsp;as long as you use a bank account, a supported debit card or credit card to fund your payments.&nbsp;With Rhombus, we only charge 2.9% + 30c per transaction to receive payments or donations; we cover the monthly cost of your assigned Rhombus number, including all the messaging fees associated with the payments you receive. Please contact us for volume pricing.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-col w-col-3">
            <div class="icon-wrapper">
              <h4 class="faqs-section-1-text">WHAT BANKS DO YOU WORK WITH?</h4>
              <p class="faqs-section-1-text">Your Rhombus account works with all the major banks in the United States.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-col w-col-3">
            <div class="icon-wrapper">
              <h4 class="faqs-section-1-text">WHEN ARE FUNDS DEPOSITED INTO MY ACCOUNT?</h4>
              <p class="faqs-section-1-text">We currently offer two day payouts for 25c/payout. The payments you receive via Rhombus are bundled and paid out to your bank account in two business days on a rolling basis.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-row row-spc x2 faqs-section-2">
          <div class="w-col w-col-3">
            <div class="icon-wrapper">
              <h4 class="faqs-section-1-text">WHAT COUNTRIES CAN I USE RHOMBUS IN?</h4>
              <p class="faqs-section-1-text">Rhombus is currently only available in the U.S. We are adding support for other countries soon.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-col w-col-3">
            <div class="icon-wrapper">
              <h4 class="faqs-section-1-text">WHAT PHONES DOES RHOMBUS WORK ON?</h4>
              <p class="faqs-section-1-text">Rhombus works on any phone with text messaging capability.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-col w-col-3">
            <div class="icon-wrapper">
              <h4 class="faqs-section-1-text">WHAT IF MY PHONE IS LOST OR STOLEN</h4>
              <p class="faqs-section-1-text">In the event that your phone is stolen or misplaced, simply log into your Rhombus account and deactivate your payment card or account.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-col w-col-3">
            <div class="icon-wrapper">
              <h4 class="faqs-section-1-text">WHEN ARE FUNDS DEPOSITED INTO MY ACCOUNT?</h4>
              <p class="faqs-section-1-text">We currently offer two day payouts for 25c/payout. The payments you receive via Rhombus are bundled and paid out to your bank account in two business days on a rolling basis.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="w-section section faq-section-3">
    <div class="w-container"><a class="button faqs-btn" href="/contact">I have more questions</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="w-section section paralax mobile-landscape">
    <div class="w-container">
      <div class="customers-section-6-title">
        <div>How it Works</div>
      </div>
      <div class="w-row">
        <div class="w-col w-col-4">
          <div class="div-img" data-ix="move-img">
            <img src="<%= asset_path 'Rhombus Step 1.png' %>">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-col w-col-4">
          <div class="div-img" data-ix="move-img-2">
            <img src="<%= asset_path 'Rhombus Step 2.png' %>">

          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-col w-col-4">
           <div class="div-img" data-ix="move-img-2">
            <img src="<%= asset_path 'Rhombus Step 3.png' %>">

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%= render "shared/static_pages_footer" %>
